# Leaving torpor, blocked: the blocker switches minions, then diablerizes, and a blood hunt follows.
# The rulebook ("Leave Torpor", "Diablerie", "The Blood Hunt"): a vampire in torpor can take only
# this action, undirected; blocked, there's no combat, and a blocking vampire may diablerize it.
# A blocker may switch minions while its attempt is under way (zero-vtes rules-qa 114.1).
# Cards are given by VEKN ID; names and images come from the content pack (LEGAL-08).
seed 3
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
seat D dave
crypt A 200522 *12
library A 101056 *40
crypt B 200452 *12
library B 101056 *40
crypt C 200771 *12
library C 100598 *40
crypt D 200051 *12
library D 100598 *40
start

# Fast-forward: Alice's vampire is in torpor; Bob has two archbishops, Carol a priscus, Dave a
# bishop.
A> transfer +7 A:uncontrolled:1
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> move A:ready:1 torpor
B> transfer +4 B:uncontrolled:1
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> transfer +4 B:uncontrolled:1
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> transfer +7 C:uncontrolled:1
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
D> transfer +6 D:uncontrolled:1
D> move D:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# Gisela tries to leave torpor. Bob, her prey, blocks with one archbishop, then switches to the
# other: the first attempt fails. Nobody does anything more, so the block succeeds: no combat.
A> leavetorpor A:torpor:1
expect action leave-torpor A blocks
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> block B:ready:2
A> pass
B> pass
D> pass
# Carol, not an eligible blocker, passes automatically.
expect waiting B:diablerie

# Bob diablerizes her: her blood goes to his archbishop, up to its capacity, and she is burned.
# The blood hunt follows at once, polled from Alice.
B> diablerize
expect count A:torpor 0
expect window polling minion
A> pass
B> vote against B:ready:1
B> pass
C> vote for C:ready:1
C> pass
D> vote for D:ready:1
D> pass
expect votes 4 2
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
# Passed, 4 to 2: the diablerist is burned, and the action ends, blocked.
A> pass
expect action none
expect count B:ready 1
